DATA AND CONTENT (not covered by the MIT license above)

The MIT license covers only the scripts in this repository. It does not cover
the data the scripts download or the ZIM files they produce.

- Texas statute and constitution text: published by the Texas Legislative
  Council (https://statutes.capitol.texas.gov/). Statutes are public law.

- Structured data: OpenStatutes.org, Texas Constitution and Statutes release,
  licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
  (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. If you share a ZIM
  or any other output built from this data, you must credit OpenStatutes.org
  and indicate the license. The build adds that credit to the landing page,
  every page footer, and the ZIM metadata.

Neither this project nor OpenStatutes.org is affiliated with the State of
Texas or any government agency. The output is not an official publication.
